{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27294","headline":"[秋]稼如云 · 蒋防","name":"[秋]稼如云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肆目如云处，三田大有秋。\n葱茏初蔽野，散漫正盈畴。\n稍混从龙势，宁同触石幽。\n紫芒分羃羃，青頴澹油油。\n始惬仓箱望，终无灭裂忧。\n西成知不远，雨露复何酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}